{"ref":"BDB, גְּדִי","hw":"גְּדִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדִי</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27\" href=\"/Genesis.27\">Gn 27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9\" href=\"/Genesis.9\">9</a> <strong>kid (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">جَدْىٌ</span> Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">גדא</span>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּדְיָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܰܕܝܳܐ</span>; cf. Assyrian <em>gadû, gadiia</em>, Meissner<sup> ZA iv. 1889, 286</sup> Zehnpfund<sup>BAS i. 505</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:17\" href=\"/Genesis.38.17\">Gn 38:17</a> + 12 times (abs. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:23\" href=\"/Genesis.38.23\">Gn 38:23</a> +, & (generally) cstr. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:17\" href=\"/Genesis.38.17\">Gn 38:17</a> +); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדָיִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.3\">1 S 10:3</a>, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדָיֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:9\" href=\"/Genesis.27.9\">Gn 27:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:16\" href=\"/Genesis.27.16\">16</a>;—<em>kid</em>, almost always <span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳ עִזִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:9\" href=\"/Genesis.27.9\">Gn 27:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:16\" href=\"/Genesis.27.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:17\" href=\"/Genesis.38.17\">38:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:20\" href=\"/Genesis.38.20\">20</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:19\" href=\"/Judges.6.19\">Ju 6:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:15\" href=\"/Judges.13.15\">13:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:19\" href=\"/Judges.13.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:1\" href=\"/Judges.15.1\">15:1</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.20\">1 S 16:20</a>; abs. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:19\" href=\"/Exodus.23.19\">Ex 23:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:26\" href=\"/Exodus.34.26\">34:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.21\">Dt 14:21</a> (all <span dir=\"rtl\">לא תבשׁל ג׳ בחלב אמו</span>), & c. art. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:23\" href=\"/Genesis.38.23\">Gn 38:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:6\" href=\"/Judges.14.6\">Ju 14:6</a>; abs. pl. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.3\">1 S 10:3</a>;—cf. also <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵין גֶּ֫דִי</span>.","next":"BDB, גְּדִיָּה","prev":"BDB, גדיה"}